  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0: CSV import & export. Export every synonym group from the backoffice (toolbar button or GET /export) and bulk-import with merge or replace-all modes; duplicates are skipped using diacritics-insensitive comparison. No breaking API changes. v1.0.0: Initial release. Synonym management UI in Settings sidebar, diacritics-insensitive Examine index (ASCIIFoldingFilter), 25 pre-loaded synonym groups, REST API, automatic integration with uTPro.Extension.Search.",
